OL,3,GNEWSAPaedophile admits faking
OL,4,Areferences for nursery job
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former nursery worker jailed for
OL,7,Fpossessing indecent images of children
OL,8,Fhas admitted faking references to get
OL,9,Fanother job in childcare.
OL,11,FKristian Parry, 27, was jailed in March
OL,12,Ffor possessing more than 5,000 images
OL,13,Fwhile working at a nursery in Leeds.
OL,15,FFollowing his conviction it emerged he
OL,16,Fhad applied for a job at another
OL,17,Fnursery after his arrest, using fake
OL,18,Femail addresses to send bogus
OL,19,Freferences to secure employment.
OL,23,APub: 02-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
